        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to create a Python script that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it provides a managed service for monitoring and logging metrics. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use it to interact with the CloudWatch service. </thinking>\n",
